<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">Kharam: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">2 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc1">TIMOTHY Diang Paul Inni Huuina Chemajia</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTHY</para>
  <para style="mt2">Diang Paul Inni Huuina Chemajia</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Hiwa 2 Timothy larik hi</char> Tirton Paul in ama siamruoi Timothy diangnga woini huuina chemajia eii. 2 Timothy hi Paul ringkhuo juohek sik tiangnga imajia eii. Hiwa phatak hin ama kha Rome mikhumna khan aleiom (2 Tim 1:16). Paul Timothy le innaitheiya inlei-inlop halli apha rakip-ah ama kha asapa angnga aleilei (Phil 2:22, 1 Tim 1:2, 1:18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Hiwahi Paul in koisuok rathuulla miring inkhat diangnga imajia chemajia mili karra inkhat kha eii. Khawa chemajia aleiilak inthum ngai khachu 1 Timothy, Titus, halli Philemon hi eii.</para>
  <para style="ip">2 Timothy hi amajia pha Rome Reng in Christian ngaikha inleiminpoong. Hiwahin ajar eya Paul hi mikhumna ah ileiom lei-echa halli Timothy diang kapoong-karaal deinasik aleiminchu. 1 Timothy angnga Paul in Timothy diang akatuunmak ocha ngai jarra chong katamtak aleipeii (1 Tim 1:16-18). Halli ama innum Timothy diang nahong-intongpui sik intakthei pha ngaikha alaheiwasik eii tia aleirilpi (3:1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Asuungnga kaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paul in Timothy minpaak-ah chemajia phutna anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Halli ama malung leimasokpi. <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 1:3-18">1:3-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ama'n Timothy diang deiraat nasik amasok. <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 2:1-13">2:1-13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ama'n Timothy diang arei ka-e minchuna lekkhat aleipeii. <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 2:14-26">2:14-26</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">5. Ama'n nuktiangnga kasuoksik jar halli katuun lamma masangnasik amadiang chong leipeii. <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 3:1-4:8">3:1–4:8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">6. Paul apumtak in Timothy jarra lekkhat arilli aminhek. <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 4:9-22">4:9-22</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Pathian lungdou dungjuiya Christa Jisu tirton Paul in Christa Jisu le inruoiya inchunna suungnga eini'n nimu ringna chong-inkhitna kha rilthang nasik,<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Minriang kaom kasapa Timothy nang nadiang kiheimathuon eii:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Pa Pathian le eini Pumi Christa Jisu khan riangwai, minriang khat-um akadai kha nape rase. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Chuon 16:1</ref></char><verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Minpaakna le Masokna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Kapi kapu ngai'n inleitho angnga, inthiangnga kase katha jetnale inruoiya kei'n asepa kitho Pathian kha kaminpaak. Halli suun li zaanna kei'n Pathian kanina rakip ah nang kanangaidonna ama kha kei'n kaminpaak. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Namit rathi suok ka-ngaidonna, kei karokna pui tungtheinasik, nangkha kana-inmupuizoot.<verse eid="2TI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Napi Lois li nanu Eunice innum inngamna innei angnga na-inngamna inthiang ka-ngaidonna. Khawa kha nang nadiang-um aom ti kei'n ka-inngamna. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Chuon 16:1</ref></char><verse eid="2TI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Hiwa sik-ah nachungnga kei'n kakut kadapha Pathian nape kutchoi kha karingnga nada theinasik kei'n nangkha kanamin-ngaidon eii. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Ajarchu Pathian in einidiang akachi Ratha kha napemak; khawa rathuulla ama Ratha khan eini nasip-ah ranak, minriang khat-um nipum-insurtheina kha anapejei.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Eini Nipumi jarra sakhi kapesik injak mui; halli Christa sik surra innada keisik um injak maru. Khawa neek-ah Chong Kathasik jarra ranak ngarna Pathian in inape angnga poongna suungkhan tum kha leiru. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Eini ngai'n akatha nitho jarra emak. Takkha amatak lungdou khat-um minriangna jarra, ami naminchang nasik-ah, Christa Jisu diang nuoipil inbool makma anakoiya anasanring jei. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Takkha tuunchu eini Kanasanring Christa Jisu ajuo jarra einidiang namalarpijei. Ama'n thina ranak aminmangnga, halli chongkahoi jarra akathi kaommak ringkhuo kha amalarjei<verse eid="2TI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Chong Katha karil inthangsik, tirton khat-um ocha inkhat angnga Pathian in kei anakadangjei, <char style="rq"><ref loc="1TI 2:7">1 Tim 2:7</ref></char><verse eid="2TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />hiwa ngaisik jarra kei'n poongraal kidei eii. Takkha hiwa sik-ah kei injakmong, ajarchu ki-ngamna ama kha kei'n kajet; halli ama'n kei diangnga inape nikhuo aheitung maklaiseng ama'n keihi karingnga nada matorte ti kei'n katha tak-ah kajet. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Christa Jisu le inruoiya eini ni-inchunna ka-e inngamna khat-um inriangna khan om chak-ah juinasik, nang sik-ah minkhina kei'n kinaminchu akatuun chong ngaikha kacheet ah mahuumro. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Nang nadiangnga inapeii akatha ngaikha eini suungnga karingnga kaom Ratha Inthiang ranak jarra indatharo.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Phygelus li Hermogenes inchella, Asia ramma kaom mi rakip kei innamathaan jei, tikha nangni'n ningjet. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Onesiphorus innsuungnga Pumi riangwai kha omrase, Ajarchu ama'n apha angjet malung hoina anapeya kei mikhumna ah kiom kha ama lei-injakmak, <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />takkha ama Rome heitungli heitungmak anamu maklaiseng anaheiratok. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Pumi'n ariangwai kha ama chungnga khawa Nikhuo khan perase! Halli Ephesus ah ama'n keisik angtuk katam ithome tikha nang in katha tak-ah najet.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu Christa sik-ah Raalmi Katuun Inkhat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Kasapa, nang sik-ah Christa Jisu le ni-inchunna suungnga riangwai jarkhan kangar kha ero. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Sakhi katamtak ngai maikuungnga kei diangnga ningjet kanaminchuna ngaikha lei-inlang rilpiro, halli ngamna kaom mi, mileiilak ngai kaminchu mator ngaidiang um pero.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Christa Jisu chongkajui raalmi inkhat angnga Poongraalna kha deiro. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Raalmi eya kaom miringkhan ama lamkakeipa malung mintai sik amanuom khawa jarra micham ngai ringkhuo chuon khale achuon minchunmak. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Ruolsiak taanna-ah kataan inkhat in juisik dan kha ajuimak inchu ataanman kha ralaang matornuni. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Chuon kangarra katho leimi ama khan leirakhool mansakhet tum kha amusik eii. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Pumi'n nangdiang angrakip jetna anapesik ejarra, angme kei'n kirilhi ngaidonro.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Kei'n kiril Chong Katha suungnga kinaminchu angnga, kathiya inphut akaring David phungrui inkhat ka-e Jisu Christa ama kha ngaidon chakro. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Kei'n Chong Katha kha karil jarra dan kamakoi mi inkhat angnga thirruiya innakhit-ah kapoong kaleidei. Takkha Pathian chong khachu leikhit matormu, <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />khawa jarra Pathian ikadang mi ngai innum Jisu Christa sanminringna jarra akajuo hektik-kaboi lurna kha inmuthei nasik, inmani jarra angrakip kei'n kidei eii. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Hiwahi akadik chongril kha eii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Eini amale nithisuom inchu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">amale eini um niringsuom sik eii.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Eini'n nideichei inchu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">amale eini um wai niroon suomsik eii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Eini'n ama nizootmak inchu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">ama innum eini nazoot nuni. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:33">Matt 10:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:9">Luk 12:9</ref></char><verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Eini ngamna kacha ni-emak innum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">amachu ngamna kacha echei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">ajarchu ama atheinuo-ah maleisei inthotheimak.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inthiang Chuonkatho Malarna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Hiwa chong ngai chungnga nami ngai'n insuol-inseiimak nasik Pathian maikuungnga kana tak-ah chong pe-inlang minngaidonro. Hiwahi akatha emak, takkha akarangai mi ngaibit mangnasik eii. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Akatuun Pathian chongkha katuunna kaminchu inkhat e-inlang, ama chuonna injak kaneimak chuonmi angnga, Pathian mitmuwa puikatungnga malarnasik nimatorseng kha thoro. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Inthiangmak khat-um kamo inseiina ah inphut looiru, hiwa ngaihin mi ngaikha Pathian diangnga inphut kalaak-ah aruoisik eii. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Khawa ka-ang minchuna khachu akapaan mason-masonna taksa kabaksuo ka-ang kha eii. Khawa ngai kaminchu miring inni khachu, Hymenaeus li Philetus in-eii. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Inmani'n akatuun lamkha inmathaanna, eini ringnookna kha ahekjei tia kangamna angjet ngai ngamna kha inminmang.<verse eid="2TI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Takkha Pathian innmundeeng kacheet khachu, kanikphuk mator enuni; khawa chungnga chongkha hinthoa injia om, “Pumi'n ami ngaiseng kha ajet” halli “Tu ka-ang in inmani Pumi ta kin-eii katingai khachu inthosialna-ah inphut inheikir cheisik eii,” ati. <char style="rq"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Teelna 16:5</ref></char><verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Innkalok inkhat suungnga bukheeng khat-um ankheeng aphung rakip aom: lekkhat in soonna li dangka ah inbool, aleiilak ngaikhan thingnga khat-um neipilla inbool um aom: lekkhat khachu kapoi chuonna inneiman nasik, halli aleiilak ngai khachu kachamma inneiman angnga inneiman nasik eii. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Tu ka-ang in hiwa akathamak ngai rakip-ah inphut intheinuo ah ininthiang inchu, kapoidom jarra inneimansik eii, ajarchu inmani kha inmani Karu'n neiman sik-ah inpesuok chuon katha rakip sik-ah ininsuuk eii. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Khangdoong laiya taksa manuom ngaikha mathaanro, halli malung inthiang tak-ah Pumi'n asan nasik ah kakoi ngaile inruoiya akatuun tiang, inngamna tiang, minriangna tiang halli akadai kha katha ah juiro. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Takkha akamo li chongkajuimak ngai murruolsiak ah inphut taanro; khawa khachu ahekna-ah insuolna eii, itikha nang-in najet. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Pumi suok inkhat sik-ah, nang mi le insuol emaro. Nangchu mi rakip diang riangwai kanei, akatha, kadeiraat ocha inkhat kha na-esik eii. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Ni-inhalpui ngaikha malung kadaiya namintuunsik eii, ajarchu Pathian in inmani diang malung thuulnasik aphakacha apesik eii halli akatuun kha inhongjetsik eii. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Halli ama'n alungdou minjui sik tia isur ngaikhan inlungsing hongsuokta Seitan chaangnga inphut inheisuoksik eii.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ajuohekna Nikhuo ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Ajuohekna sik nikhuo ngai khanchu intakthei pha la-esik eii tihi ngaidonro. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Mi ngai'n intheinuo sik, saak-inraam, in-or, khat-um atheinuo ah inriltha, miminjakna, nulepa chongkajuimak, thopiman kajetmak, biaklam kajuimak; <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />inmani mi minriang kajetmak, riangwai kajetmak mikarilse, insuol-inseii halli chikaom in-esik eii; inmani'n akatha kha inmatirsik eii; <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />kathamak palaak katho, chuon ka-uoimak, halli in-or khan kasip in esik eii; Pathian neek-ah taksa hoina khan kheella kamanuom; <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />halli tuol tiangnga eini biaklam kajui omchan katho, takkha khawa inthiangtak ranak khachu inmani'n kazootmak inlahong omsik eii. Hiwa ka-ang mi ngaidiangnga inphut taandelro. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Inmani lekkhat in mi ngai inna inluut-ah manuomna rakip in ruoinarei iruoijei halli inleitho manu ngai'n minpoongnga kaom akasuol numeisa ngai insurra inlei-ompui, <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />numeisa ngai'n akadik kha apha rakip-ah jetnasik inleitho takkha akadik kha supjet leijet matormu.<verse eid="2TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Jannes le Jambres in Moses diang inzoot makthei angnga, malung kaziingjei khat-um ngamna jarra kasuoljei hiwa mi ngai innum akadik kha zootmu, <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 7:11">Suok 7:11</ref></char><verse eid="2TI 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Takkha Jannes le Jambres chungnga kasuok angnga, mi rakip in angtuk inmani inmome tikha inlamusik eii. Inmani akalaak simator nunu.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahekna Minchuna ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Takkha nangchu karingkhuo ah kingaidon, kaomchan, halli kanaminchuna ngaikha naheijuijei; halli ka-inngamna, kakhaang raatna, kaminriangna, kadei raatna, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />kei kapoongna khat-um karaalna ngaikha naheimujei. Antioch ah, Iconiumma, Lystra ah chikaom poongna kei'n kiheidei, omchan kasuok rakip nang in najet! Takkha khawa ngai rakip ah inphut Pumi'n kei anasanjei. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Christa Jisu le inruoiya inchunna suungnga pathian ringkhuo ah karing kamanuom mi rakip poongraal inmusik eii. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />halli mi kathamak ngaile katha omchan katho ngaikhan inmani maleisei intho inta halli mileiilak ngai kha-um maleisei inminthosik eii, akase in ena-ah inphut kheella kase in esik eii. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Takkha nangsik achu, akatuun kha nalei inchu jei halli na-inngamna khan kacheet-ah omtaro. Ajarchu nakaru ngai kha tu ngai in-eme nang in najetjei; <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />halli nasiinlaiya inphut singna kanape mator Christa Jisu ngamna jarra sanminringna katung nakaruoi Chong Inthiang nijetjei kha nang in ngaidonro. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Ajarchu Chong inthiang rakip hi Pathian phuuksaan khanna eii, akatuun kha minchunasik, akamasial kha rakooknasik, akatuunmak kha mintuunnasik, halli akadik ringkhuo minchuna jarra nemna kaom kha eii. <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />Khawajarra Pathian sepa katho mi khan chuon katha rakip thonasik ah rahoi kasuok khat-um puikatung enasik kha eii.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Akathi le akaring chongkatan sik Christa Jisu le Pathian maikuungnga kei'n nang riangwai tak-ah kinakoi eii: ajarchu ama reng angnga waikaroonsik alajuosik eii, <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Apha e-innum emak innum Pathian chongkha rilro, minjetro, ranro, halli malung masokpiro, halli deiraatna rakiple inruoiya minchuro. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Ajarchu mi ngai'n chongkatuun kha inrangai zootmakpha alahongsik eii. Takkha inpumtak in inmanuom kha jui inta halli inmani'n angme inrangaizoot karilpi ocha ngaikha kheel kheella inmanisik bit-ah inlakhoom chunsik eii. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Inmani'n akatuunna inphut inkuor mahei inta halli thiming maruo ngaikhan inmalung inminluutsik eii. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Takkha nangchu ajar rakip ah natheinuoa malung insurro; kapoong khaangro, Pathian suok inkhat na-ena nachuon rakip malarnasik Chong Katha karil inkhat na-ena chuon kha thoro.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Keisik achu ka-inpesuok nasik phadan ahongnaijei; hiwa ringkhuo hi kamathaan nasik kei sik-ah apha anaijei. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Kei'n ruolsiak kitaan kha katha-ah kataanjei, kei'n ahekna katung kha kataanjei, halli ngamna kha kaneijei. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Tuunchu matorna chuonthoman akatuun renglukhu kha kei sik-ah anangaak chak-ah omjei; khawa nikhuo khan chongtan katuun Pumi khan anapesik ejei. Khawa kha keisik bit emak, takkha ama juo-inlar nasik kha riangwai tak-ah kangaak rakip diang apesik eii.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apumtak Chong ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Keidiang innot-ah naheiwa nasik nang sik-ah kathakhet kha thoro. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Ajarchu Demas in tuunlaiya nuoipilchung hi aminriangnga kei anamathaanna Thessalonica tiang asijei. Crescens in Galatia tiang asijei, halli Titus in Dalmatia tiang asijei.<verse eid="2TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luke bitchu keile inruoiya omjei. Nang in Mark kha ratok inlang halli nang in ama kha hongruoiro, ajarchu ama'n kachuon hi anasan mator. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 4:10">Col 4:10</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Philem 24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Chuon 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref></char><verse eid="2TI 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Tychicus chu kei'n Ephesus tiang katirjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Chuon 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:21">Eph 6:21</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7">Col 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:8">8</ref></char><verse eid="2TI 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Nang in nahongpha Carpus diang Troas ah kida kasongkol kalok khale larik ngai kha-um, halli kapoidoomma sawunna inbool larik ngai kha heichoiro. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 20:6">Chuon 20:6</ref></char><verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alexander thirkasutpa in kei anaminpoong theijei; ama'n angme itho dungjuiya Pumi'n athoman amaleiisik eii. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Ama chungnga nang natheinuoa insingtheiro, ajarchu eini chongril hi zootmak-ah araang theiya om.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Mansakhet-ah kei kapumtak ka-inngaak pha, tuteii kei sik-ah nangirpui mu, inraya-ah kei innataandel. Inmani chungnga Pathian in akathamak machulpi marase! <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Takkha kei'n chong kha kariltung matornasik halli zaatlop rakip in chong kha injetnasik, Pumi khan kei anaompui halli keidiang ranak anapeya thina sik-ah inphut kei anasanjei. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Halli Pumi khan akathamak rakip ah inphut nasanta ama marwaan Rengramma kei anaruoisik eii, apha rakip ah ama lurna erase! Amen<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahekna Minpaak Chong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Kei'n Priscilla le Aquila han Onesiphorus innsuung mi ngaidiang minpaak chong kanaheipeii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Chuon 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 1:16">2 Tim 1:16</ref>,<ref loc="2TI 1:17">17</ref></char><verse eid="2TI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erastus in Corinthia ah aom jei, halli Miletus ah Trophimus ama ana jarra kei'n kaheidajei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 19:22">Chuon 19:22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:4">20:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 21:29">21:29</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Rom 16:23</ref> </char><verse eid="2TI 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Phalbitha matiang heiwanasik nang ranak-ah thoro.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Eubulus, Pudens, Linus, Claudia halli aleiilak Christian rakip ngai'n inmani minpaak chong innaheipeii.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Pumi'n naratha kha naompui pichak rase.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Pathian riangwai khan nangni rakip diang naompui chak rase.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>